(Su Lin 5/9/94)

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:52.000
I am a handmaid.

00:02:54.479 --> 00:02:55.520
So what?

00:02:57.479 --> 00:02:59.639
There is no humble status,

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:02.719
only humble personality.

00:03:03.919 --> 00:03:05.199
I may look ordinary,

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:09.879
but my soul is so shining.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.719
I may look ordinary,

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:16.879
but my soul

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:20.960
is so shining.

00:03:21.879 --> 00:03:22.840
What are you reading?

00:03:23.879 --> 00:03:24.919
The Little Mermaid.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.360
- Give it back.
- In English?

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:27.520
- Give it back!
- Catch.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:29.800
Give it back!

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:30.800
Give it here!

00:03:31.319 --> 00:03:32.800
I am a handmaid.

00:03:32.919 --> 00:03:34.159
So what?

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.680
There is no humble status,

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:38.120
only humble personality.

00:03:38.479 --> 00:03:39.919
I may look ordinary,

00:03:40.039 --> 00:03:42.479
but my soul is so shining.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:44.240
Look how she shines.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.439
You?

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.120
A shining soul?

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:48.159
Give me my book back.

00:03:49.159 --> 00:03:49.919
You want it?

00:03:50.199 --> 00:03:50.719
Come on.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:52.599
Come get it.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:53.319
Ma Na.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:55.800
Return her book.

00:04:01.439 --> 00:04:02.199
- My book!
- Ma Na!

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:05.719
What's the fine for ruining
a library book?

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.039
Three times the cover price, I think.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:19.959
Keep the change.

00:04:20.279 --> 00:04:20.800
You...

00:04:22.601 --> 00:04:23.399
Ma Na.

00:04:38.841 --> 00:04:39.399
Coming.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:50.199
The phone never rang.

00:04:58.428 --> 00:04:59.160
It works fine.

00:05:07.399 --> 00:05:08.279
Toilet leaking again?

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:10.959
No.

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:13.439
Out of gas?

00:05:14.991 --> 00:05:15.431
No.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:17.720
Then what's wrong?

00:05:18.839 --> 00:05:20.040
Do I need a problem

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:20.839
before I can visit?

00:05:23.639 --> 00:05:26.199
Your neighbor's girl is Su Lin, right?

00:05:26.199 --> 00:05:27.720
(Su Lin)

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.680
Any progress?

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.000
Come back!

00:07:19.642 --> 00:07:20.680
Come back!

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:21.800
Come back!

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:22.759
Come back!

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:25.839
Come back!

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:27.439
Come back!

00:07:33.319 --> 00:07:34.000
Come back!

00:07:38.519 --> 00:07:42.000
Come back!

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:55.959
Come back!

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:57.240
Come back!

00:07:57.959 --> 00:07:58.480
Come back!

00:07:59.759 --> 00:08:01.959
Come back!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:05.879
Come back!

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:09.959
Come back!

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:05.240
You think something's off.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.919
But people handle these files.

00:09:08.519 --> 00:09:10.879
A few discrepancies are possible.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:12.879
Right.

00:09:15.279 --> 00:09:17.759
We still have no solid evidence

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:18.679
to tell us

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:22.240
whether the girl disappeared

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:24.279
or had an accident.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.120
(Followed?)
So everything here...

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.360
(Withdraw? Transfer?)
Questions. Uncertain.

00:09:31.039 --> 00:09:31.679
Gu.

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:33.360
You've done all you can.

00:09:34.039 --> 00:09:35.480
You did right by the badge

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:36.840
and by yourself.

00:09:39.519 --> 00:09:40.600
You're a good cop.

00:09:44.039 --> 00:09:44.679
Mr. Gu.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.720
If you hadn't driven my dad

00:09:48.159 --> 00:09:49.279
to the hospital that day,

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.799
he would've died.

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:55.200
Thank you.

00:10:00.039 --> 00:10:00.879
It snowed hard then.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:02.799
I was on duty

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:04.679
when I came across

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:06.039
a stroke victim.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.799
I rushed him into my cruiser.

00:10:09.519 --> 00:10:11.960
I'd been lazy and hadn't fueled up.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.120
Two miles out,

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:15.799
the car ran dry.

00:10:16.919 --> 00:10:18.000
The man's son and I

00:10:18.039 --> 00:10:18.879
lifted him up

00:10:18.879 --> 00:10:19.559
and carried him

00:10:19.879 --> 00:10:20.720
all the way there.

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:23.559
The doctor said

00:10:24.519 --> 00:10:25.159
we were five minutes late.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:28.240
So he'd have been paralyzed.

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:37.159
But cops see things like that a lot.

00:10:39.159 --> 00:10:40.320
Being a cop

00:10:42.679 --> 00:10:45.399
isn't always as glorious as it seems,

00:10:45.559 --> 00:10:46.519
(Award)
or proud of.

00:10:47.679 --> 00:10:49.039
There's so little we can fix.

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:52.279
Looking back,

00:10:53.879 --> 00:10:54.799
there are more regrets.

00:11:03.339 --> 00:11:05.339
We only get a few decades in life.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:07.519
Studying English?

00:11:07.947 --> 00:11:08.458
Yeah.

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:10.159
Going abroad?

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.159
Paris.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:15.080
Paris.

00:11:16.679 --> 00:11:17.919
I've long wanted to see Paris.

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:19.639
The Louvre.

00:11:20.799 --> 00:11:21.799
Notre-Dame.

00:11:22.841 --> 00:11:25.242
I want to see the bell-ringer's home.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:28.480
Quasimodo.

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:39.639
Gu.

00:11:41.159 --> 00:11:41.600
Gu.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:42.759
Say something.

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:43.799
Du Qian said yes.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.360
Yes to what?

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:49.320
To marrying me.

00:11:54.039 --> 00:11:54.879
She also wrote

00:11:55.519 --> 00:11:57.240
that I should go home with her in May

00:11:57.919 --> 00:11:58.799
to meet her parents.

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:04.080
Congratulations.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.039
Don't just congratulate me.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.120
You'll need time off too.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.840
You're the only choice for best man.

00:12:12.159 --> 00:12:12.960
Without you,

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.120
this wedding wouldn't be happening.

00:12:15.639 --> 00:12:16.039
You bet.

00:12:17.879 --> 00:12:18.519
I'll be there.

00:12:20.399 --> 00:12:22.000
My part's done.

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.279
I'll give you all my drafts later.

00:12:25.919 --> 00:12:26.559
Read them later,

00:12:27.399 --> 00:12:28.240
or you'll get caught.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.279
Don't worry.

00:12:31.018 --> 00:12:33.219
I memorized every word
while copying them.

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:35.720
Who rings the bells at Notre-Dame?

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:39.559
Don... Quixote.

00:12:41.559 --> 00:12:42.519
Quasimodo.

00:12:43.279 --> 00:12:45.519
So much for knowing it by heart.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.000
Read up when you can,

00:12:47.759 --> 00:12:48.799
or you'll be exposed.

00:12:49.039 --> 00:12:50.519
Then I've got a lot of reading to do.

00:12:51.639 --> 00:12:52.440
If I'd known,

00:12:52.879 --> 00:12:54.320
I'd have made you less bookish.

00:12:54.559 --> 00:12:55.320
Me, bookish?

00:12:56.519 --> 00:12:57.720
It all came from in here.

00:13:00.919 --> 00:13:01.519
Gu.

00:13:02.679 --> 00:13:03.879
Honestly,

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:06.879
without the letters you wrote,

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.120
I'd never have won Du Qian over.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.360
Good. Don't forget it.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:14.799
See you.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:24.919
I forgot something.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:26.879
What?

00:13:27.799 --> 00:13:29.240
That Culture Center I go to

00:13:29.559 --> 00:13:32.080
has dance, calligraphy and tai chi.
Everything.

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:33.120
(Culture Center)
Consider it.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:34.000
Okay.

00:13:35.639 --> 00:13:36.919
Call if you need help with it.

00:13:37.279 --> 00:13:37.559
Wait.

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:39.159
Is that the kind of dancing

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:40.159
you do with Wu?

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:41.679
Not this again.

00:13:42.559 --> 00:13:43.279
Oh, stop it.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.720
Who can tell me what just happened?

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:59.320
Ma Na tore up my book.

00:14:03.048 --> 00:14:03.568
Ma Na.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:05.440
Why did you do that?

00:14:07.559 --> 00:14:08.120
Like I said.

00:14:09.159 --> 00:14:10.080
I only run the contest.

00:14:10.159 --> 00:14:11.159
I can't handle it all.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:13.360
But what you did today

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.480
seriously disrupted rehearsal.

00:14:16.919 --> 00:14:17.600
So?

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:18.480
Ma Na.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.000
Give the book back first.

00:14:26.559 --> 00:14:28.200
Why are your nails still painted red?

00:14:29.799 --> 00:14:30.399
What about it?

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:35.120
Ms. Wang.

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:38.240
I think we should recast

00:14:38.399 --> 00:14:39.000
the Mermaid.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:40.080
Why?

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:41.759
Because I painted my nails red?

00:14:42.879 --> 00:14:43.320
Yes.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.759
That's exactly why.

00:14:45.879 --> 00:14:46.960
Those red nails

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.639
undermine the Little Mermaid.

00:14:48.639 --> 00:14:49.480
It'll ruin her.

00:14:49.799 --> 00:14:50.639
You're a bad teacher.

00:14:50.679 --> 00:14:51.720
You're just picking on me.

00:14:51.799 --> 00:14:52.279
Ma Na!

00:14:52.279 --> 00:14:53.360
Think I'm scared of you?

00:14:53.919 --> 00:14:54.799
You can't do a thing.

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:56.559
You live off your wife
at the Center,

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:58.360
yet you act like you're somebody.

00:14:59.679 --> 00:15:01.279
You talk like some stuck-up phony.

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:02.679
Who are you to lecture me?

00:15:02.759 --> 00:15:03.320
Ma Na!

00:15:07.228 --> 00:15:08.380
How could she say that?

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:08.892
Exactly.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.120
She's got some nerve.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:11.000
Mr. Zhou.

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:13.559
Mr. Zhou.

00:15:15.159 --> 00:15:15.919
She's just a kid.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:17.639
Don't take it personally.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:20.590
You...

00:15:26.919 --> 00:15:27.960
All right, show's over.

00:15:28.519 --> 00:15:29.200
Class dismissed.

00:15:31.519 --> 00:15:32.399
That was insane.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:33.960
Ma Na.

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:35.399
Give back my book.

00:15:36.159 --> 00:15:36.919
Not a chance.

00:15:37.679 --> 00:15:38.480
Tell the principal.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:39.440
Let him ask my dad.

00:15:41.159 --> 00:15:42.240
You little tattletale.

00:15:42.399 --> 00:15:43.399
I'll sew your mouth shut.

00:16:44.366 --> 00:16:48.494
(Teacher-Student Conflict?)
(Classmate Conflict? Vocational School)

00:16:51.279 --> 00:16:52.799
Now I'm completely lost.

00:16:53.039 --> 00:16:53.840
I don't know

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.080
if something happened to Su Lin,

00:16:56.159 --> 00:16:57.159
or if I'm just bored

00:16:57.919 --> 00:17:00.039
and seeing suspects everywhere.

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:02.240
You can't keep going in circles.

00:17:02.759 --> 00:17:04.119
Either see it through

00:17:04.279 --> 00:17:05.559
and get some answers,

00:17:06.119 --> 00:17:07.160
or let it go

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:09.279
and focus on your health.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.119
Do whatever gives you peace.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:13.200
This indecision

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.240
gets you nowhere

00:17:14.279 --> 00:17:15.440
and wears you out.

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:24.799
An old geezer should enjoy life.

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:28.440
That Culture Center I go to

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:31.200
has dance, calligraphy and tai chi.
Everything.

00:17:31.519 --> 00:17:32.319
Think about it.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:37.759
We only get a few decades in life.

00:17:42.559 --> 00:17:43.839
Be a good old man for once.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:56.720
(Husband and Wife)

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.220
(Su Lin, Training Dept. Student)

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.480
(Sister and Brother)

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:04.800
(Su Weiguo, Laid-off Worker)

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:06.800
(Su Zhe)

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:15.840
(Su Lin)

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.420
(Su Lin)

00:19:10.519 --> 00:19:11.240
Please.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.279
Can you let me out of here?

00:19:15.759 --> 00:19:16.839
Please let me go home.

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:40.119
Gu.

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:41.720
I heard

00:19:41.839 --> 00:19:43.680
you saw my mom again today.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.319
Make any progress?

00:19:45.799 --> 00:19:46.640
Watch your mouth.

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:49.039
Your mom

00:19:49.799 --> 00:19:51.119
called me an old geezer

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.559
who should enjoy life.

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:54.160
She said to join the Center

00:19:55.319 --> 00:19:57.359
and take dance and painting classes.

00:19:58.559 --> 00:19:59.960
She said while I'm still healthy,

00:20:00.599 --> 00:20:02.559
I should become more well-rounded.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.480
Okay, okay. Enough already.

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:05.720
Just stop.

00:20:05.799 --> 00:20:07.680
Dance? Painting?

00:20:07.759 --> 00:20:08.680
Well-round...

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:14.319
Painting... Well-rounded.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:16.920
Gu, gotta go.

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:20.880
That kid.

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:24.640
I never told him the news.

00:20:31.319 --> 00:20:32.119
Good stuff.

00:20:32.559 --> 00:20:33.480
You're wasted.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.440
That idiot rookie of yours

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:37.279
went after a map

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:38.519
and risked his life,

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:40.400
trying to drink me under.

00:20:41.279 --> 00:20:42.559
He should've asked around

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:44.359
about my tolerance.

00:20:44.559 --> 00:20:45.440
Keep bragging.

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:46.480
What map?

00:20:48.759 --> 00:20:49.960
Why all the secrecy?

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.000
The kid bites off more than he can chew.

00:20:57.319 --> 00:20:58.240
Just like you.

00:20:58.559 --> 00:20:59.720
Who are you calling reckless?

00:20:59.799 --> 00:21:00.240
Enough.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:01.920
Take care of him.

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:03.359
No need to see me out.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:04.920
Take care.

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:05.680
- Bye.
- Chen.

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:08.079
Explain yourself before you leave.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:09.519
Why is he so heavy?

00:21:09.519 --> 00:21:10.519
Here, drink some water.

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:11.559
Here. Have some water.

00:21:11.799 --> 00:21:12.400
Drink up.

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:16.039
I feel awful.

00:21:16.759 --> 00:21:17.839
You're not drunk?

00:21:19.079 --> 00:21:20.400
Why the act?

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:22.039
I swapped my liquor

00:21:22.279 --> 00:21:23.680
for water when he wasn't looking.

00:21:24.319 --> 00:21:26.480
Otherwise, how would I get this gem?

00:21:28.765 --> 00:21:30.799
(Chaobei Underground Utility Map)

00:21:30.799 --> 00:21:32.079
These black lines

00:21:33.119 --> 00:21:34.240
on the transparent overlay

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.920
show the storm drain network.

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:39.519
The colored layer

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:41.119
is our city map.

00:21:42.079 --> 00:21:43.720
They're at the exact same scale.

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:45.400
Layered, they make a 3D map.

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:46.759
And Engineer Chen

00:21:47.319 --> 00:21:48.519
also marked the location

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:49.720
of every storm drain.

00:21:50.319 --> 00:21:52.200
What good does that do?

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:54.960
By matching the streets and sewers,

00:21:55.440 --> 00:21:57.079
we can identify

00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:59.599
every drain leading to Weihong Canal.

00:22:00.240 --> 00:22:01.839
That drastically cuts our workload.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:03.559
For the killer

00:22:03.559 --> 00:22:06.200
to dump a body without being seen,

00:22:07.519 --> 00:22:09.640
we can rule out areas above ground

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:11.839
with heavy foot traffic.

00:22:12.119 --> 00:22:14.119
Then rule out the buffer zone.

00:22:14.359 --> 00:22:15.160
For example,

00:22:15.440 --> 00:22:17.000
bees don't forage beside their hive.

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.400
They go farther afield.

00:22:18.680 --> 00:22:20.079
The killer wouldn't murder

00:22:20.079 --> 00:22:22.400
someone near his own home.

00:22:23.359 --> 00:22:24.839
So we focus our search

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:27.000
on low-traffic points in Area B,

00:22:27.079 --> 00:22:27.960
around storm drains.

00:22:29.759 --> 00:22:30.319
Exactly.

00:22:30.880 --> 00:22:31.960
We've got work to do, guys.

00:22:32.480 --> 00:22:34.559
Let's identify every storm drain

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:35.720
that fits.

00:22:36.039 --> 00:22:36.680
Yes, Captain.

00:22:37.256 --> 00:22:41.628
(Chaobei Vocational High School)

00:22:46.200 --> 00:22:46.799
Jiang Ting.

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:48.880
I needed you.

00:22:49.119 --> 00:22:49.920
Mr. Zhou.

00:22:53.079 --> 00:22:54.680
Ms. Wang got it back for you.

00:22:56.559 --> 00:22:57.359
Thank you, Mr. Zhou.

00:22:58.039 --> 00:22:58.519
I read it.

00:22:58.920 --> 00:23:00.960
You added a few lines for Maid C.

00:23:01.119 --> 00:23:01.880
They were good.

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:03.079
I like them.

00:23:03.880 --> 00:23:04.440
I...

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:06.920
I didn't write those.

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:08.319
I like them,

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:09.559
but can't use them.

00:23:10.160 --> 00:23:11.119
If we did,

00:23:11.440 --> 00:23:13.000
they'd upstage the prince

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:14.039
and the Mermaid.

00:23:17.680 --> 00:23:18.400
Mr. Zhou.

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:20.880
Are you okay after that?

00:23:21.480 --> 00:23:22.240
I'm fine.

00:23:23.039 --> 00:23:24.319
I won't let something so small

00:23:24.319 --> 00:23:25.519
get to me.

00:23:26.319 --> 00:23:27.079
Neither should you.

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:29.279
Be brave enough to be yourself.

00:23:30.599 --> 00:23:32.240
Only people who are afraid inside

00:23:32.480 --> 00:23:33.880
pretend to be strong.

00:23:34.519 --> 00:23:35.519
The truly strong

00:23:36.119 --> 00:23:37.279
stay calm through anything.

00:23:37.960 --> 00:23:38.480
Right?

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:40.720
You and Ma Na.

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:43.480
You're the one who's truly strong.

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:45.200
No, no.

00:23:45.799 --> 00:23:47.240
I'm really scared of Ma Na.

00:23:48.279 --> 00:23:50.440
Just thinking of school scared me.

00:23:50.640 --> 00:23:51.400
Fear is okay.

00:23:51.759 --> 00:23:53.160
Everyone's afraid of something.

00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:55.839
I was afraid of plenty as a kid.

00:23:56.279 --> 00:23:57.160
Looking back now,

00:23:57.839 --> 00:23:58.799
it was no big deal.

00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:03.000
It's late. I'll drive you home.

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:04.359
No need.

00:24:04.680 --> 00:24:06.079
I don't want to trouble you.

00:24:06.319 --> 00:24:07.079
Haven't you heard?

00:24:07.400 --> 00:24:08.680
It's not safe outside now.

00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:12.039
I'm not going home.

00:24:12.599 --> 00:24:13.720
I want to see my dad first.

00:24:14.279 --> 00:24:15.680
Where is he? I'll take you.

00:24:21.519 --> 00:24:22.039
Get in.

00:24:23.799 --> 00:24:25.400
I really don't want to trouble you.

00:24:25.480 --> 00:24:27.240
The best way not to trouble a teacher

00:24:27.519 --> 00:24:28.799
is to get home safe.

00:24:35.119 --> 00:24:36.000
Buckle up.

00:24:38.359 --> 00:24:38.839
Thanks.

00:24:38.839 --> 00:24:39.759
Okay. Take care.

00:24:43.319 --> 00:24:43.680
Captain.

00:24:45.279 --> 00:24:46.440
I checked that area.

00:24:46.599 --> 00:24:47.759
It's a dead end,

00:24:47.880 --> 00:24:49.279
with small shops on both sides.

00:24:49.319 --> 00:24:50.920
Food stalls, convenience stores,

00:24:51.160 --> 00:24:52.200
and a window shop.

00:24:52.440 --> 00:24:53.319
That's it.

00:24:55.240 --> 00:24:57.440
The shops are all closed by now.

00:24:59.559 --> 00:25:00.559
It's eight. About right.

00:25:00.759 --> 00:25:01.559
They'd be closed.

00:25:02.680 --> 00:25:03.119
Oh, right.

00:25:04.279 --> 00:25:05.119
Captain, look here.

00:25:05.799 --> 00:25:07.720
We can mark this storm drain too.

00:25:08.119 --> 00:25:08.920
Including this one,

00:25:08.920 --> 00:25:10.759
we have 34 storm drains

00:25:11.079 --> 00:25:13.160
that fully match

00:25:13.519 --> 00:25:14.960
the killer's likely MO.

00:25:15.640 --> 00:25:18.599
Then we'll focus our canvass

00:25:18.680 --> 00:25:20.440
on these 34 locations.

00:25:20.599 --> 00:25:20.960
Okay.

00:25:21.240 --> 00:25:21.559
Move!

00:25:21.559 --> 00:25:21.839
Move!

00:25:22.799 --> 00:25:23.440
You wanna die?

00:25:33.559 --> 00:25:34.440
I suspected before

00:25:34.519 --> 00:25:36.880
that the killer had a record.

00:25:37.480 --> 00:25:39.839
That would mean the killer

00:25:40.200 --> 00:25:41.880
has a low, unstable income.

00:25:46.880 --> 00:25:47.440
Come on. Move.

00:25:47.960 --> 00:25:49.079
It reeks in here.

00:25:50.000 --> 00:25:50.519
Come on.

00:25:52.759 --> 00:25:53.559
See?

00:25:54.039 --> 00:25:54.799
Wrong direction.

00:25:57.160 --> 00:25:59.880
Low-income drifters

00:26:00.880 --> 00:26:02.000
have one drawback.

00:26:04.440 --> 00:26:06.559
Most people avoid them.

00:26:06.880 --> 00:26:08.960
A victim wouldn't follow one anywhere.

00:26:09.160 --> 00:26:09.720
Right.

00:26:10.279 --> 00:26:12.759
And they lack the necessary tools.

00:26:13.920 --> 00:26:16.200
The victims' bodies were all naked.

00:26:16.960 --> 00:26:17.759
At Weihong Canal,

00:26:17.839 --> 00:26:19.599
we didn't find her clothes

00:26:19.960 --> 00:26:20.880
or personal effects.

00:26:21.279 --> 00:26:22.759
Even if the killer lived

00:26:23.000 --> 00:26:24.279
near the dump site,

00:26:24.559 --> 00:26:26.519
he couldn't carry a body

00:26:26.880 --> 00:26:28.039
through the streets.

00:26:32.559 --> 00:26:33.599
Unless...

00:26:35.160 --> 00:26:37.279
he has his own car.

00:26:46.559 --> 00:26:47.920
The killer is most likely

00:26:48.319 --> 00:26:50.599
an ordinary, mild-mannered man.

00:26:50.839 --> 00:26:51.519
Nothing unusual.

00:26:51.839 --> 00:26:53.400
At least, he isn't off-putting.

00:26:53.680 --> 00:26:54.960
He's also someone

00:26:55.319 --> 00:26:57.160
people wouldn't guard against.

00:26:57.400 --> 00:26:58.480
A man like that

00:26:58.559 --> 00:26:59.799
probably does fine with women.

00:27:00.839 --> 00:27:02.839
So why rape and murder them?

00:27:03.640 --> 00:27:04.960
When is

00:27:06.119 --> 00:27:07.200
that Professor Qiao free?

00:27:08.000 --> 00:27:09.160
We should consult him.

00:27:09.480 --> 00:27:09.960
Okay.

00:27:24.599 --> 00:27:27.519
This road is deserted at night.

00:27:28.559 --> 00:27:29.680
Many streetlights are out.

00:27:30.799 --> 00:27:32.000
That's why girls

00:27:32.279 --> 00:27:33.559
shouldn't walk here alone.

00:27:34.359 --> 00:27:35.000
Got it?

00:27:35.982 --> 00:27:36.462
Yeah.

00:27:39.480 --> 00:27:40.400
Mr. Zhou.

00:27:42.279 --> 00:27:43.960
You're strong too, aren't you?

00:27:46.559 --> 00:27:47.240
Strong?

00:27:49.880 --> 00:27:51.000
Do I look it?

00:27:53.640 --> 00:27:55.599
You always seem so unruffled.

00:28:06.599 --> 00:28:08.160
What's going on?

00:28:11.039 --> 00:28:12.119
Your mom won't let you go?

00:28:12.680 --> 00:28:13.319
It wasn't her.

00:28:15.160 --> 00:28:16.240
I decided for myself.

00:28:16.839 --> 00:28:17.599
I won't go to Beijing.

00:28:17.880 --> 00:28:18.519
Ting.

00:28:19.240 --> 00:28:20.759
I already submitted the request

00:28:20.759 --> 00:28:21.759
to transfer your residency.

00:28:22.920 --> 00:28:23.400
Dad.

00:28:25.359 --> 00:28:26.440
Wanting to be a reporter

00:28:28.279 --> 00:28:29.519
was a long time ago.

00:28:39.559 --> 00:28:40.359
It's okay, Ting.

00:28:41.960 --> 00:28:43.720
Whatever you decide,

00:28:44.559 --> 00:28:45.400
I'll support you.

00:28:52.480 --> 00:28:53.480
You know what, Dad?

00:28:55.119 --> 00:28:57.079
I also like Lu Yao's books,

00:28:58.279 --> 00:28:59.319
Qi Qin's music,

00:29:00.759 --> 00:29:01.799
and Stephen Chow's movies.

00:29:02.519 --> 00:29:03.799
I know Stephen Chow.

00:29:04.119 --> 00:29:05.480
He's the really funny one,

00:29:06.000 --> 00:29:06.880
the comedian.

00:29:07.200 --> 00:29:07.640
Right?

00:29:09.359 --> 00:29:10.279
Who are the other two?

00:29:11.799 --> 00:29:12.720
Here.

00:29:12.920 --> 00:29:13.319
Here.

00:29:13.960 --> 00:29:16.119
Tell me their names.

00:29:16.359 --> 00:29:17.039
Write them down.

00:29:17.359 --> 00:29:19.200
I'll buy you their books and tapes.

00:29:19.200 --> 00:29:19.839
Here.

00:29:20.119 --> 00:29:20.799
No, Dad.

00:29:21.640 --> 00:29:23.039
All the things I like,

00:29:23.799 --> 00:29:24.559
you didn't know.

00:29:26.960 --> 00:29:28.000
But Mom did.

00:29:37.079 --> 00:29:37.599
Ting.

00:29:38.440 --> 00:29:41.000
I know you're a good kid.

00:29:41.960 --> 00:29:43.240
You're worried going away

00:29:43.480 --> 00:29:44.400
will upset your mom.

00:29:45.920 --> 00:29:46.720
But look,

00:29:47.759 --> 00:29:49.599
you have to think of it this way.

00:29:51.319 --> 00:29:52.160
You're still young.

00:29:53.279 --> 00:29:54.839
You have a bright future.

00:29:55.559 --> 00:29:56.960
You can't let someone else

00:29:56.960 --> 00:29:58.319
cost you that future.

00:29:59.119 --> 00:29:59.680
Right?

00:30:01.160 --> 00:30:02.720
And taking the entrance exam in Beijing

00:30:02.839 --> 00:30:05.359
is a chance most people only dream of.

00:30:08.119 --> 00:30:08.759
Think it over.

00:30:09.359 --> 00:30:10.200
Take your time.

00:30:14.039 --> 00:30:15.519
I read a book recently.

00:30:18.680 --> 00:30:19.200
Dad.

00:30:21.960 --> 00:30:22.920
I want to be braver.

00:30:23.529 --> 00:30:24.119
Good.

00:30:27.160 --> 00:30:28.400
No more of this today.

00:30:29.119 --> 00:30:29.960
Let's just eat.

00:30:30.480 --> 00:30:31.640
We can talk later.

00:30:31.799 --> 00:30:32.480
Come on. Eat.

00:30:33.759 --> 00:30:34.200
That one's

00:30:34.519 --> 00:30:35.000
cold.

00:30:35.359 --> 00:30:36.680
I'll wrap you a fresh, hot one.

00:30:38.200 --> 00:30:38.640
No scallions.

00:30:39.200 --> 00:30:39.640
Right.

00:30:40.119 --> 00:30:40.519
Okay.

00:30:42.720 --> 00:30:43.319
A big one.

00:30:44.359 --> 00:30:45.920
Come on, everyone. A toast.

00:30:46.000 --> 00:30:46.720
Come on, class.

00:30:47.960 --> 00:30:49.319
Class Three!

00:30:49.640 --> 00:30:51.640
Second to none!

00:30:51.799 --> 00:30:53.240
Cheers!

00:30:59.279 --> 00:30:59.799
Meiyu.

00:30:59.920 --> 00:31:01.319
I really owe you for last time.

00:31:01.440 --> 00:31:02.079
Without you,

00:31:02.240 --> 00:31:03.160
I'd still be

00:31:03.200 --> 00:31:04.559
stuck back in that little county.

00:31:05.079 --> 00:31:06.160
We're classmates.

00:31:06.200 --> 00:31:07.799
I was happy to help.

00:31:08.160 --> 00:31:09.160
Here's to you.

00:31:09.240 --> 00:31:09.680
Cheers.

00:31:13.960 --> 00:31:15.400
Moving to the city made me realize

00:31:15.559 --> 00:31:17.160
that in a good environment,

00:31:17.319 --> 00:31:18.720
you're surrounded by good people.

00:31:19.440 --> 00:31:20.200
Another?

00:31:20.480 --> 00:31:21.160
No more.

00:31:21.599 --> 00:31:22.680
Meiyu's drunk. Sit down.

00:31:22.759 --> 00:31:23.279
Exactly.

00:31:23.680 --> 00:31:24.480
- Next time.
- No.

00:31:25.039 --> 00:31:25.960
Meiyu.

00:31:26.359 --> 00:31:27.240
I need a favor

00:31:27.240 --> 00:31:28.319
from your dad.

00:31:28.599 --> 00:31:29.440
True colors.

00:31:29.440 --> 00:31:30.480
Oh, come on.

00:31:31.440 --> 00:31:32.400
Ignore them.

00:31:32.680 --> 00:31:33.359
Let's have one.

00:31:33.359 --> 00:31:33.920
Come on.

00:31:34.799 --> 00:31:36.359
It's fine. We'll do this next time.

00:31:39.279 --> 00:31:40.480
It's okay. It's okay.

00:31:40.759 --> 00:31:41.839
Don't move. I've got it.

00:31:42.160 --> 00:31:42.880
Watch the glass.

00:31:45.279 --> 00:31:45.960
Meiyu.

00:31:46.000 --> 00:31:47.519
You're so lucky.

00:31:47.759 --> 00:31:48.920
Zhou is so

00:31:49.000 --> 00:31:51.079
gentle and thoughtful.

00:31:51.400 --> 00:31:52.880
And his job is good and steady.

00:31:53.119 --> 00:31:55.039
Exactly. I'm so jealous.

00:31:55.559 --> 00:31:56.640
It's steady,

00:31:57.000 --> 00:31:58.759
but there's no future in it.

00:31:59.640 --> 00:32:00.759
Without my dad,

00:32:01.480 --> 00:32:02.920
he couldn't have landed

00:32:02.920 --> 00:32:03.720
that Center job.

00:32:04.400 --> 00:32:05.519
- Not true.
- Oh, please.

00:32:05.920 --> 00:32:08.759
Zhou is quite the literary giant.

00:32:09.599 --> 00:32:10.440
You're too kind.

00:32:10.559 --> 00:32:11.400
How so?

00:32:12.640 --> 00:32:14.200
His poetry

00:32:14.279 --> 00:32:16.880
was published in City Daily.

00:32:17.559 --> 00:32:19.000
In the paper? Really?

00:32:19.079 --> 00:32:19.680
Zhou.

00:32:19.839 --> 00:32:20.720
That's impressive.

00:32:20.960 --> 00:32:21.680
Be honest.

00:32:21.960 --> 00:32:22.599
Did he

00:32:22.720 --> 00:32:24.799
ever write you love poems?

00:32:25.200 --> 00:32:25.960
Did he?

00:32:26.240 --> 00:32:26.880
Come on.

00:32:27.039 --> 00:32:28.079
Recite one!

00:32:28.519 --> 00:32:30.640
Recite one for us, Zhou.

00:32:30.759 --> 00:32:31.880
No, no.

00:32:32.200 --> 00:32:33.319
Come on! One poem!

00:32:33.319 --> 00:32:34.000
No, no.

00:32:34.839 --> 00:32:35.880
I'll cut some fruit.

00:32:37.920 --> 00:32:38.920
We have plenty, Zhou.

00:32:39.079 --> 00:32:39.599
Meiyu.

00:32:39.720 --> 00:32:40.720
Meiyu, recite one.

00:32:41.359 --> 00:32:42.359
Come on, Meiyu.

00:32:42.559 --> 00:32:43.480
Recite one for us.

00:32:43.640 --> 00:32:45.720
One! One! One!

00:32:45.799 --> 00:32:47.160
Fine. I'll do it.

00:32:48.119 --> 00:32:48.960
Let me think.

00:32:52.880 --> 00:32:53.720
Zhou Xijie.

00:32:54.440 --> 00:32:56.160
How did that poem start again?

00:32:57.440 --> 00:32:59.200
It's been so long, even I forgot.

00:33:02.240 --> 00:33:03.400
Think hard, Meiyu.

00:33:04.640 --> 00:33:08.759
Earth's pain scorches in the sun.

00:33:09.799 --> 00:33:10.839
Such fancy words.

00:33:10.920 --> 00:33:12.599
Zhou sure knows how to put on airs.

00:33:13.319 --> 00:33:16.319
Light incense. Bathe. Bow down.

00:33:16.799 --> 00:33:18.880
She must be worshipped.

00:33:19.680 --> 00:33:21.720
Yes, she must.

00:33:21.960 --> 00:33:23.079
Incredible!

00:33:23.119 --> 00:33:25.839
Devotion, met with scorn.

00:33:26.519 --> 00:33:27.839
Giving up your whole future now?

00:33:28.079 --> 00:33:31.960
Favored, then lost in the maze.

00:33:33.079 --> 00:33:33.920
Who?

00:33:34.119 --> 00:33:35.400
Who got lost?

00:33:35.960 --> 00:33:39.480
Love gleams like stalks of rice.

00:33:40.640 --> 00:33:44.240
Lowered eyes. Licked lips. Entwined.

00:33:47.160 --> 00:33:49.279
She must be worshipped.

00:33:49.640 --> 00:33:51.519
Yes, she must.

00:33:51.559 --> 00:33:52.880
Come on. Cheers!

00:33:52.920 --> 00:33:53.880
To worship!

00:33:54.599 --> 00:33:55.440
Let's worship her!

00:33:55.480 --> 00:33:56.880
Worship! Worship!

00:34:05.000 --> 00:34:06.759
All right, you two. Enough.

00:34:08.079 --> 00:34:09.400
His poem was so corny.

00:34:09.440 --> 00:34:10.960
How would I know what it meant?

00:34:11.159 --> 00:34:13.599
Not corny. Sweet.

00:34:13.679 --> 00:34:15.079
It was full of love.

00:34:28.760 --> 00:34:29.559
You're cheerful.

00:34:31.679 --> 00:34:34.000
Very different from a few days ago.

00:34:36.000 --> 00:34:37.320
Was it that obvious?

00:34:38.920 --> 00:34:40.760
I thought I'd hidden it well.

00:34:41.280 --> 00:34:42.119
I'm your mom.

00:34:42.599 --> 00:34:44.400
I can read you like a book.

00:34:46.599 --> 00:34:47.840
You never tell me anything.

00:34:52.079 --> 00:34:53.960
I had one tiny little dilemma.

00:34:54.559 --> 00:34:56.000
Just a tiny one.

00:34:56.880 --> 00:34:58.239
But I've figured it all out now.

00:34:58.519 --> 00:34:59.119
I can tell.

00:35:10.559 --> 00:35:12.000
I've always wanted this.

00:35:12.719 --> 00:35:13.960
How'd you know I'd like it?

00:35:14.280 --> 00:35:16.079
Your English exam is coming up.

00:35:16.320 --> 00:35:17.039
Train your ear.

00:35:23.239 --> 00:35:24.760
I've always wanted this.

00:35:26.000 --> 00:35:26.519
Mom.

00:35:27.480 --> 00:35:29.239
There are lots of other things I like.

00:35:29.719 --> 00:35:30.800
Don't push your luck.

00:35:31.159 --> 00:35:31.840
If I'm good,

00:35:31.840 --> 00:35:33.280
will you keep buying me stuff?

00:35:33.840 --> 00:35:35.119
Do your homework first.

00:35:36.480 --> 00:35:37.800
And finish your apple.

00:35:38.106 --> 00:35:38.682
Okay.

00:35:58.840 --> 00:36:00.960
There is no humble status,

00:36:02.239 --> 00:36:03.760
only humble personality.

00:36:05.559 --> 00:36:06.880
I may look ordinary,

00:36:08.599 --> 00:36:11.760
but my soul is so shining.

00:37:55.599 --> 00:37:57.039
Come on. Bottoms up.

00:38:07.280 --> 00:38:07.639
Okay.

00:38:07.760 --> 00:38:08.159
Hey.

00:38:10.079 --> 00:38:13.400
You know Mr. Ma's
family pretty well, right?

00:38:14.119 --> 00:38:15.239
I'm just a hired hand.

00:38:16.719 --> 00:38:18.039
He's a big boss.

00:38:18.360 --> 00:38:19.360
How close could we be?

00:38:20.519 --> 00:38:23.079
Didn't you say you knew his daughter?

00:38:24.480 --> 00:38:25.920
Speaking of Mr. Ma,

00:38:26.159 --> 00:38:27.039
his daughter

00:38:27.719 --> 00:38:29.000
is a real handful.

00:38:31.519 --> 00:38:33.760
You're fishing for information.

00:38:34.239 --> 00:38:35.880
So that's why

00:38:36.079 --> 00:38:36.960
you bought me drinks.

00:38:42.960 --> 00:38:44.159
You gave me all that work

00:38:45.039 --> 00:38:46.039
and raised my pay.

00:38:46.719 --> 00:38:49.880
I know Ma Dongchen arranged it all.

00:38:51.480 --> 00:38:53.480
Just tell me the truth.

00:38:54.360 --> 00:38:56.280
What happened to my daughter?

00:38:58.146 --> 00:39:01.146
Take my advice. Listen to Mr. Ma.

00:39:02.159 --> 00:39:03.400
Move on.

00:39:04.199 --> 00:39:04.639
You...

00:39:07.800 --> 00:39:09.199
This money is all yours.

00:39:09.679 --> 00:39:11.360
Just tell me the truth.

00:39:16.599 --> 00:39:17.360
I can't take it.

00:39:17.599 --> 00:39:19.840
You refusing only scares me more.

00:39:21.000 --> 00:39:21.679
Please.

00:39:22.360 --> 00:39:23.880
You're a father too.

00:39:25.440 --> 00:39:27.000
If your daughter went missing,

00:39:27.639 --> 00:39:29.440
could you just let it go?

00:39:38.559 --> 00:39:39.400
You're right.

00:39:39.599 --> 00:39:40.840
Our own flesh and blood.

00:39:41.239 --> 00:39:41.679
But

00:39:43.800 --> 00:39:45.239
what can I say?

00:39:52.800 --> 00:39:53.599
Take my advice.

00:39:54.800 --> 00:39:57.519
For your wife and son's future,

00:39:59.719 --> 00:40:02.519
act as if he's your only child.

00:40:20.519 --> 00:40:23.079
He really did get my girl killed.

00:40:40.039 --> 00:40:40.480
Su.

00:40:41.960 --> 00:40:42.840
What's wrong?

00:40:48.000 --> 00:40:49.280
Ma Dongchen!

00:40:52.280 --> 00:40:52.679
Su.

00:40:52.679 --> 00:40:53.960
Get out here!

00:40:54.119 --> 00:40:54.719
Been drinking?

00:40:55.320 --> 00:40:55.679
Su.

00:40:55.840 --> 00:40:56.679
No helmet, no entry.

00:40:56.679 --> 00:40:57.400
- Move!
- Su!

00:40:57.599 --> 00:40:59.079
Get lost!

00:40:59.400 --> 00:41:00.719
Ma Dongchen!

00:41:01.840 --> 00:41:03.400
Get out here!

00:41:03.800 --> 00:41:05.639
Ma Dongchen!

00:41:06.719 --> 00:41:08.400
Get out here!

00:41:08.840 --> 00:41:09.599
What's going on?

00:41:09.599 --> 00:41:10.320
Mr. Ma isn't here.

00:41:10.400 --> 00:41:11.199
Come back tomorrow.

00:41:11.280 --> 00:41:12.639
Like hell he isn't!

00:41:12.920 --> 00:41:14.199
I saw his car.

00:41:14.480 --> 00:41:15.480
He really isn't here.

00:41:15.599 --> 00:41:16.679
Ma Dongchen!

00:41:17.239 --> 00:41:18.960
Get out here!

00:41:19.039 --> 00:41:20.199
Su, stop yelling.

00:41:20.199 --> 00:41:21.280
- He isn't here.
- Move.

00:41:21.360 --> 00:41:22.199
Don't shove me.

00:41:22.360 --> 00:41:22.960
Liang.

00:41:24.440 --> 00:41:25.079
Let him up.

00:41:32.639 --> 00:41:33.119
Su.

00:41:33.679 --> 00:41:34.440
Have you eaten?

00:41:35.400 --> 00:41:35.920
Braised pork.

00:41:38.679 --> 00:41:40.360
What happened to my girl?

00:41:41.440 --> 00:41:42.559
Have you lost your mind?

00:41:42.679 --> 00:41:44.760
You owe me an answer today.

00:41:45.199 --> 00:41:46.599
You're drunk.

00:41:52.599 --> 00:41:53.519
Hey, Su.

00:41:53.840 --> 00:41:55.159
Say something!

00:41:55.400 --> 00:41:57.480
What happened to my girl?

00:41:57.760 --> 00:41:58.360
Liang.

00:41:58.679 --> 00:41:59.760
Stay out of it.

00:41:59.920 --> 00:42:00.719
He asked for it.

00:42:00.800 --> 00:42:01.239
Liang.

00:42:01.800 --> 00:42:02.320
Get up.

00:42:08.920 --> 00:42:09.400
Go down.

00:42:12.440 --> 00:42:13.239
Be careful.

00:42:17.239 --> 00:42:18.320
You won't talk?

00:42:19.360 --> 00:42:21.199
Your silence says you're guilty.

00:42:21.760 --> 00:42:23.280
I'm going straight to the police.

00:42:23.360 --> 00:42:23.800
Go.

00:42:24.239 --> 00:42:25.320
Go right now.

00:42:34.639 --> 00:42:35.360
Before you do,

00:42:35.360 --> 00:42:37.000
repay the fine I covered for your son.

00:42:42.719 --> 00:42:44.800
I'll sell everything to repay you.

00:42:45.639 --> 00:42:46.400
And if I can't,

00:42:46.400 --> 00:42:47.920
I'll do time.

00:42:48.679 --> 00:42:50.360
But if you hurt my daughter,

00:42:51.039 --> 00:42:53.000
yours will never know peace either.

00:42:53.000 --> 00:42:53.719
You wouldn't dare.

00:43:05.920 --> 00:43:06.719
Su.

00:43:09.639 --> 00:43:11.840
If you end up in prison for years,

00:43:12.519 --> 00:43:13.719
your family will be finished.

00:43:14.679 --> 00:43:15.880
Your daughter is already gone.

00:43:16.719 --> 00:43:17.599
Your son is here,

00:43:18.079 --> 00:43:19.360
and he's finally back on track.

00:43:19.960 --> 00:43:21.559
Can you think of him for once?

00:43:27.079 --> 00:43:28.760
I've told you over and over.

00:43:29.719 --> 00:43:31.760
Her disappearance was an accident.

00:43:32.360 --> 00:43:33.440
Your daughter matters,

00:43:33.599 --> 00:43:35.199
but mine doesn't?

00:43:35.480 --> 00:43:37.159
Having a little money

00:43:37.280 --> 00:43:39.440
doesn't mean you can fix everything.

00:43:39.960 --> 00:43:41.960
Calm down, Su.

00:43:41.960 --> 00:43:43.880
Can we talk this out?

00:44:05.461 --> 00:44:08.372
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

00:44:11.079 --> 00:44:12.840
I want my sister!

00:44:15.280 --> 00:44:16.880
I might as well be dead.

00:44:17.199 --> 00:44:19.719
I'm not so rotten I'd leave you to die.

00:44:24.280 --> 00:44:25.000
Please.

00:44:25.719 --> 00:44:26.920
Please let me go.

00:44:27.280 --> 00:44:28.239
Mom's waiting for me.

00:44:28.360 --> 00:44:29.440
My dad is too.

00:44:29.440 --> 00:44:30.599
My little brother's home.

00:44:31.239 --> 00:44:32.280
They all want me home.

00:44:32.280 --> 00:44:32.880
Mr. Gu.

00:44:33.239 --> 00:44:34.800
I miss my sister. What do I do?

00:45:08.508 --> 00:45:11.831
♪Never loud, never surging♪

00:45:12.291 --> 00:45:17.091
♪I gather my worries and build a wall♪

00:45:18.495 --> 00:45:22.623
♪Around me♪

00:45:23.055 --> 00:45:26.228
♪By my pillow, I hear♪

00:45:26.228 --> 00:45:31.604
♪A dark fairy tale♪

00:45:36.192 --> 00:45:39.412
♪One burst of pain♪

00:45:39.412 --> 00:45:43.296
♪A thousand flowers bloom♪

00:45:47.849 --> 00:45:53.261
♪Now I stand with myself♪

00:45:54.336 --> 00:45:57.600
♪Each becomes the other's shore♪

00:46:29.129 --> 00:46:32.073
♪By my pillow, I hear♪

00:46:32.453 --> 00:46:37.061
♪A dark fairy tale♪

00:46:42.348 --> 00:46:45.292
♪One burst of pain♪

00:46:45.620 --> 00:46:49.716
♪A thousand flowers bloom♪

00:46:54.221 --> 00:46:59.341
♪The struggle inside the silence♪

00:47:00.621 --> 00:47:04.190
♪Who can hear♪

00:47:08.100 --> 00:47:09.892
♪It?♪